齊女，未入室，而宣公見所欲爲太子婦者好，説而自取之，更爲太子取他女。宣公得齊女，生子壽、子朔，令左公子傅之。太子伋母死，宣公正夫人與朔共讒惡太子伋。宣公自以其奪太子妻也，心惡太子，欲廢之。及聞其惡，大怒，乃使太子伋於齊而令盜遮界上殺之，與太子白旄，而告界盜見持白旄者殺之。且行，子朔之兄壽，太子異母弟也，知朔之惡太子而君欲殺之，乃謂太子曰：「界盜見太子白旄，卽殺太子，太子可毋行。」太子曰：「逆父命求生，不可。」遂行。壽見太子不止，乃盜其白旄而先馳至界。界盜見其驗，卽殺之。壽已死，而太子伋又至，謂盜曰：「所當殺乃我也。」盜并殺太子伋，以報宣公。宣公乃以子朔爲太子。十九年，宣公卒，太子朔立，是爲惠公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001549","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"夫人夷姜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001552","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"夷姜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001552","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"伋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001553","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001553","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"右公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001554","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"右公子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001554","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001553","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"齊女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001555","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001549","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m013-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"太子婦","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名